Your devotion to nature has made your body more attuned to the natural world and resistant to unnatural energies.

You gain [28, 38, 46, 52, 58 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Spell save, [23%, 31%, 37%, 42%, 46% (TL1-5; MP 100)] Arcane resistance, and [5.8%, 12%, 16%, 19%, 22% (TL1-5)] Nature damage affinity.

You defy arcane forces, so that any time you take damage from a spell, you restore [4.3, 5.7, 6.9, 7.8, 8.7 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Equilibrium each turn for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns.

The effects increase with your Mindpower.
